#: src/postulo/templates/server/maps.html
msgid "The map is drawn on OpenStreetMap's public tiles. Each viewer's browser fetches them from tile.openstreetmap.org, which learns that browser's address and the area it looks at — where that person's companies are. It is sent this instance's address as the page asking, never the page itself."
msgstr "Il-mappa titfassal fuq it-tiles pubbliċi ta' OpenStreetMap. Il-browser ta' kull min iħares iġibhom minn tile.openstreetmap.org, li jsir jaf l-indirizz ta' dak il-browser u ż-żona li qed iħares lejha — fejn jinsabu l-kumpaniji ta' dik il-persuna. Jintbagħatlu l-indirizz ta' din l-istanza bħala l-paġna li qed titlob, qatt il-paġna nnifisha."

#: src/postulo/templates/server/maps.html
msgid "The map is drawn on the tiles at the address below. When it is on another server, that server learns each viewer's address and the area they look at; on this instance's own address, nothing is sent anywhere."
msgstr "Il-mappa titfassal fuq it-tiles fl-indirizz hawn taħt. Meta jkun fuq server ieħor, dak is-server isir jaf l-indirizz ta' kull min iħares u ż-żona li qed iħares lejha; fuq l-indirizz ta' din l-istanza stess, ma jintbagħat xejn imkien."

#: src/postulo/templates/server/maps.html
msgid "The map is drawn on the world's outline, kept on this instance. Nothing is fetched from anywhere, and the map cannot show streets."
msgstr "Il-mappa titfassal fuq il-kontorn tad-dinja, miżmum f'din l-istanza. Ma jinġieb xejn minn imkien, u l-mappa ma tistax turi t-toroq."

